# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# PhysioAI frontend configuration (copy to .env)
#
# Only VITE_-prefixed variables are exposed to the browser bundle. Anything in
# this file is PUBLIC: it ships to every visitor inside the JavaScript bundle.
#
# NEVER put a SECRET_KEY, DATABASE_URL, SMTP password, JWT secret or any private
# API credential in a VITE_* variable. The backend's own settings live in
# backend/.env.example and stay server-side.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Base URL of the FastAPI backend.
#
# REQUIRED for a production build. `npm run build` aborts if this is unset or
# points at a local address, because a deployed bundle cannot reach a server on
# the visitor's machine. `npm run dev` falls back to http://localhost:8000.
#
# Local development:
VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:8000
#
# Production (set this in the Vercel project settings, not in a committed file -
# it is baked into the bundle at build time, so changing it requires a redeploy).
# Replace the angle-bracket host with the real Railway service domain:
# VITE_API_URL=https://<api-service>.up.railway.app
#
# `npm run build` rejects a missing URL, a localhost URL and any documentation
# placeholder such as "your-fastapi-backend-url.com" or "api.example.com",
# because such a bundle deploys successfully and then fails for every visitor.

# Where the MediaPipe WASM runtime is served from.
#
# Defaults to /mediapipe/wasm, which is self-hosted: the runtime is copied out of
# node_modules into public/mediapipe/wasm by scripts/copy-mediapipe-assets.mjs on
# `npm install`, `npm run dev` and `npm run build`. Nothing is fetched from a
# third-party CDN, so pose tracking works offline and in a clean checkout.
#
# Only set this if you deliberately host the runtime elsewhere.
# VITE_POSE_WASM_PATH=/mediapipe/wasm

# Location of the pose model (*.task).
#
# Defaults to Google's pinned MediaPipe model CDN:
#   .../pose_landmarker_lite/float16/1/pose_landmarker_lite.task
# The path is version-pinned (float16/1), never "latest".
#
# Set this to a self-hosted copy to remove the last outbound request the
# application makes. Fetch it with scripts/fetch-pose-model.mjs and point this at
# the result.
# VITE_POSE_MODEL_URL=/mediapipe/models/pose_landmarker_lite.task
